  <body>

    <div>

      <p begin="00:24.700" end="00:26.200" ttm:agent="v1">Hi</p>

      <p begin="00:25.610" end="00:28.940" ttm:agent="v1">I don't wanna fall for you, but baby you're my type (nah)</p>

      <p begin="00:28.940" end="00:32.200" ttm:agent="v1">I won't even lie, I'm feeling risky, Tommy ice (ice)</p>

      <p begin="00:32.200" end="00:35.940" ttm:agent="v1">Let's go back to mine, and watch scary movies all night (yeah)</p>

      <p begin="00:35.940" end="00:38.820" ttm:agent="v1">Shawty look like Margot Robbie, she got them blue eyes</p>

      <p begin="00:38.820" end="00:42.170" ttm:agent="v1">This ain't no Brockhampton's song, but shawty, she so sweet (she so sweet)</p>

      <p begin="00:42.170" end="00:45.310" ttm:agent="v1">When I am with her my heart just feel like it's complete (it's complete)</p>

      <p begin="00:45.310" end="00:48.730" ttm:agent="v1">She so bad like Carla, I ain't talking no Elite (na-ah)</p>

      <p begin="00:48.730" end="00:52.020" ttm:agent="v1">If that girl a thot, that hoe belongs to the streets (to the streets)</p>

      <p begin="00:52.020" end="00:55.430" ttm:agent="v1">I don't wanna fall for you, but baby you're my type (nah)</p>

      <p begin="00:55.430" end="00:58.710" ttm:agent="v1">I won't even lie, I'm feeling risky, Tommy ice (ice)</p>

      <p begin="00:58.710" end="01:02.440" ttm:agent="v1">Let's go back to mine, and watch scary movies all night (yeah)</p>

      <p begin="01:02.440" end="01:05.380" ttm:agent="v1">Shawty look like Margot Robbie, she got them blue eyes</p>

      <p begin="01:05.380" end="01:08.600" ttm:agent="v1">This ain't no Brockhampton's song, but shawty, she so sweet (she so sweet)</p>

      <p begin="01:08.600" end="01:11.890" ttm:agent="v1">When I am with her my heart just feel like it's complete (it's complete)</p>

      <p begin="01:11.890" end="01:15.280" ttm:agent="v1">She so bad like Carla, I ain't talking no Elite (na-ah)</p>

      <p begin="01:15.280" end="01:20.400" ttm:agent="v1">If that girl a thot, that hoe belongs to the streets (to the streets)</p>

      <p begin="01:20.400" end="01:28.400" ttm:agent="v1"/>

      <p begin="01:42.550" end="01:45.340" ttm:agent="v1">She's a pretty shorty, and she really sweet</p>

      <p begin="01:45.340" end="01:48.790" ttm:agent="v1">She's a scream queen, that's my baby, yeah, she's unique</p>

      <p begin="01:48.790" end="01:52.140" ttm:agent="v1">She's a pretty ass actor, she's on the movie scene</p>

      <p begin="01:52.140" end="01:55.310" ttm:agent="v1">I'ma treat you really nice, let's get a Limousine</p>

      <p begin="01:55.310" end="01:58.690" ttm:agent="v1">She got blonde hair, blue skirt, baby your chanel</p>

      <p begin="01:58.690" end="02:02.050" ttm:agent="v1">Did some fucked up shit, baby you might go to hell</p>

      <p begin="02:02.050" end="02:05.320" ttm:agent="v1">I don't really give a fuck, baby I'ma go too</p>

      <p begin="02:05.320" end="02:09.120" ttm:agent="v1">Reason for that is 'cause I'll do anything for you, ay</p>

      <p begin="02:09.120" end="02:10.620" ttm:agent="v1">Said like girl (said like girl)</p>

      <p begin="02:10.340" end="02:12.490" ttm:agent="v1">Baby girl like what you want, ay</p>

      <p begin="02:12.490" end="02:15.340" ttm:agent="v1">I be all up on you, I don't even need to flaunt</p>

      <p begin="02:15.340" end="02:18.680" ttm:agent="v1">I be ditchin' all these bitches 'cause I know that you the one</p>

      <p begin="02:18.680" end="02:21.640" ttm:agent="v1">I don't need nobody else, you know I do this shit for fun</p>

      <p begin="02:21.640" end="02:23.540" ttm:agent="v1">Said what is up, you so fly</p>

      <p begin="02:23.540" end="02:26.890" ttm:agent="v1">Baby we can take a ride, I'll show you love every night</p>

      <p begin="02:26.890" end="02:30.290" ttm:agent="v1">Just so I can be your guy, just my type, you so perfect</p>

      <p begin="02:30.290" end="02:31.850" ttm:agent="v1">I already know you're worth it</p>

      <p begin="02:31.850" end="02:33.450" ttm:agent="v1">Please don't hurt me, I'm so nervous</p>

      <p begin="02:33.450" end="02:35.510" ttm:agent="v1">Put my heart up on the surface like</p>

      <p begin="02:35.510" end="02:37.010" ttm:agent="v1">Hi</p>

      <p begin="02:36.440" end="02:39.760" ttm:agent="v1">I don't wanna fall for you, but baby you're my type (nah)</p>

      <p begin="02:39.760" end="02:42.950" ttm:agent="v1">I won't even lie, I'm feeling risky, Tommy ice (ice)</p>

      <p begin="02:42.950" end="02:46.750" ttm:agent="v1">Let's go back to mine, and watch scary movies all night (yeah)</p>

      <p begin="02:46.750" end="02:49.600" ttm:agent="v1">Shawty look like Margot Robbie, she got them blue eyes</p>

      <p begin="02:49.600" end="02:52.960" ttm:agent="v1">This ain't no Brockhampton's song, but shawty, she so sweet (she so sweet)</p>

      <p begin="02:52.960" end="02:56.100" ttm:agent="v1">When I am with her my heart just feel like it's complete (it's complete)</p>

      <p begin="02:56.100" end="02:59.590" ttm:agent="v1">She so bad like Carla, I ain't talking no Elite (na-ah)</p>

